   "type": "TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus",
   "widgets_values": [
    "Redraw Picture 1 as a high-resolution illustration in exactly the same painting style as Picture 2 and Picture 3: a polished airbrushed cartoon caricature pin-up with glossy shaded skin and bright highlights, thin dark ink lines on the hair and the contours, finely detailed wavy hair with many thin strands, crisp clean edges, and a flat magenta starburst with sharp clean edges on a pure black background. Picture 1 is low-resolution pixel art of the same woman as in Picture 2 and Picture 3. Keep everything in Picture 1 exactly as it is: the composition and framing, her pose, her nude body and its proportions, her huge tilted head with the heavy-lidded green eye and purple eyeshadow, the golden-brown hair falling over the right side of her face, her arm raised up into her hair with the hand hidden in the hair, her other hand resting on her hip, her legs, her dark high-heeled shoes, the shape, position and size of the magenta starburst, the small hand-written \"RA\" signature between her feet, and all colours. There is no light-coloured border or glow around the figure: her edges meet the black background and the starburst directly. Every part stays at the same position and size in the frame. Only the resolution and the detail change: remove the pixelation. Do not add, remove or move anything, do not crop or zoom. Do not take the dress, the stockings or the poses from Picture 2 or Picture 3."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
